[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4641742327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120052#issuecomment-4641742327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120052","id":4641742327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFKtd9w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T07:09:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T07:09:01Z","body":"Depending on font size and used character count, font can use multiple textures to store glyphs (on in case of emoji is part of another font), `INSTANCE_ID` is just a draw call number and each texture will need a separate draw call, so this is expected. Also, nothing guarantee specific draw order for the glyphs, and batching can be broken for various other reasons, so this shader is wrong regardless of number of textures. `INSTANCE_ID`/`INSTANCE_CUSTOM` is intended to be used for particles.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4641742327/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused"